flowchart TD
    Start["Optimizer.aoptimize: fingerprint and create study"] --> Suggest["Suggest and reserve candidate"]
    Suggest --> Attempt["Start leased attempt"]
    Attempt --> Cache{"Compatible cache hit?"}
    Cache -->|Yes| Objective["Aggregate metrics and evaluate objective"]
    Cache -->|No| Workers["Bounded, timed sample workers"]
    Workers --> Objective
    Workers -->|Transient failure| Retry["Finish attempt with usage; bounded backoff"]
    Retry --> Attempt
    Objective --> Commit["Atomic terminal commit"]
    Commit --> Write["Write successful uncached metrics"]
    Write --> Events["Dispatch durable events in order"]
    Events --> Observe["Observe committed success"]
    Observe --> Stop{"Stopping condition reached?"}
    Stop -->|No| Suggest
    Stop -->|Yes| Result["Complete study; OptimizationResult and UsageSummary"]
    Result --> Export["Rank and export redacted JSON/CSV"]
    Events --> MLflow["Optional best-effort MLflow mirror"]
